
---

## 📄 FILE: `.gitignore`

Create this file in the **root folder** (SMART_IRRIGATION/):

```gitignore
# Arduino build files
*.hex
*.eep
*.elf
*.map
*.bin

# Build directories
build/
.build/
__vm/

# Arduino IDE files
*.ino.cpp
*.ino.globals.h
.vscode/
.vs/
*.code-workspace

# Platform.io
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/

# IDE specific
.idea/
*.iml
.settings/
.project
.cproject

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*~

# Backup files
*.bak
*.old
*.backup
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp

# Logs and databases
*.log
*.sql
*.sqlite

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Private/Secret files
secrets.h
credentials.h
password.h
config_local.h

# Documentation build files
docs/_build/
docs/.buildinfo
site/

# Python cache (if using any Python scripts)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Node modules (if you add any web tools later)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log

# Test files
test/
tests/
*.test

# Large media files (optional - remove # if you want to track images)
# *.png
# *.jpg
# *.jpeg
# *.gif
# *.pdf

# Sensitive data
*.key
*.pem
*.cer
*.p12

# Temporary files
temp/
tmp/
cache/